{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a world among you, a world that consists of abandoned concrete jungles, full of mysteries, dangers and secret passages. Your main enemy is polluted air, so along the way you will have to look for oxygen cylinders, this will add to the challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somewhere far away, there is a green paradise, but can you reach it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1511790/extras/64529f6180bceb76bf24770fa472b98b.avif?t=1755178673\" width=640 height=212 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main feature and idea of \u200b\u200bthe <strong>BRUTALIST</strong> is to enjoy the environment, especially for fans of post-apocalypse and minimalist concrete architecture. Narration through the environment, that's what awaits you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main features of the Game:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No mini map or flashing pointers on the whole screen, just environment and the goal of going to the green oasis while exploring the mystery of the dead concrete world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The element of survival is the need for oxygen, collect cylinders with this source of life along your path, go in the wrong direction - most likely you will lose...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For greater immersion in the world, game does not have a classic interface, the only indicator is the oxygen level on the cylinder behind the player.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is also dangerous with many sources of radiation, the main character has a counter, it will show with a sound signal how close you are to death.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect bits of the history of the world from the environment, and you will find out what happened.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1511790/extras/3ea29f0cfb30fb400e1ad744fcbdaaa1.avif?t=1755178673\" width=640 height=212 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1511790?t=1755178673","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1511790?t=1755178673","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1511790/bf0a37fd75b60a14d73f79563a4e14ccf40f2d53/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755178673","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1511790/bf0a37fd75b60a14d73f79563a4e14ccf40f2d53/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755178673","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a world among you, a world that consists of abandoned concrete jungles, full of mysteries, dangers and secret passages. Your main enemy is polluted air, so along the way you will have to look for oxygen cylinders, this will add to the challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somewhere far away, there is a green paradise, but can you reach it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1511790/extras/64529f6180bceb76bf24770fa472b98b.avif?t=1755178673\" width=640 height=212 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main feature and idea of \u200b\u200bthe <strong>BRUTALIST</strong> is to enjoy the environment, especially for fans of post-apocalypse and minimalist concrete architecture. Narration through the environment, that's what awaits you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main features of the Game:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No mini map or flashing pointers on the whole screen, just environment and the goal of going to the green oasis while exploring the mystery of the dead concrete world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The element of survival is the need for oxygen, collect cylinders with this source of life along your path, go in the wrong direction - most likely you will lose...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For greater immersion in the world, game does not have a classic interface, the only indicator is the oxygen level on the cylinder behind the player.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is also dangerous with many sources of radiation, the main character has a counter, it will show with a sound signal how close you are to death.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect bits of the history of the world from the environment, and you will find out what happened.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1511790/extras/3ea29f0cfb30fb400e1ad744fcbdaaa1.avif?t=1755178673\" width=640 height=212 /></span></p>","developers":["DENYS RUDYI GAMES"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1511790/header.jpg?t=1755178673","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1511790/801826/c080a77bba11ad31382d84e535ce867563c3ee0c/1750997146/dash_av1.mpd?t=1734534306","dash_h264":"https://video